WEBVTT

00:09:28.307 --> 00:09:30.331
you see your nanny,

00:09:30.355 --> 00:09:31.712
you see somebody like this,

00:09:31.736 --> 00:09:34.291
give them a great, big hug,
and tell them they belong.

00:09:34.315 --> 00:09:35.845
Make them feel like they belong.

00:09:36.856 --> 00:09:38.189
It's time for big policies,

00:09:38.213 --> 00:09:41.935
but it's also time
for big acts of kindness.

00:09:43.206 --> 00:09:45.110
Because we have to reclaim who we are,

00:09:45.134 --> 00:09:47.201
we have to reclaim this nation.

00:09:47.712 --> 00:09:50.593
(Voice breaking) And we cannot sit there

00:09:50.617 --> 00:09:52.768
and watch this shit going on.

00:09:53.791 --> 00:09:56.402
This has got to stop,
it's got to stop now.

00:09:57.196 --> 00:09:58.373
Thank you.

00:09:58.397 --> 00:10:02.682
(Applause)